{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":20.08},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":21.68,"end":41.36},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":42.76,"end":55.04}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":4.88,"text":"試算表與 CSV 讓逐列觀測資料能在工具間流通。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":5.84,"end":8.88,"text":"圖表應從觀測單位和問題開始。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":9.68,"end":14.4,"text":"這裡提供 A、B 兩組各八週的合成閱讀分鐘資料。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":15.28,"end":17.84,"text":"這些虛構數值用來示範分析，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":18.08,"end":20.08,"text":"不是真實讀者的觀測。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":21.68,"end":24.56,"text":"檢查 A 組的週次與分鐘表格。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":25.2,"end":26.16,"text":"關閉清理，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":26.48,"end":29.12,"text":"注意原始表格仍標記缺失，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":29.52,"end":32.96,"text":"但圖表與平均把該週當作零。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":33.92,"end":37.48,"text":"用範例資料選單切換 B 組。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":38.36,"end":40.08,"text":"解讀一列資料之前，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":40.16,"end":41.36,"text":"必須定義什麼？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":42.76,"end":44.56,"text":"解讀一列資料之前，"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":44.8,"end":46.08,"text":"必須定義什麼？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":47.84,"end":51.76,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":52.56,"end":55.04,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}